///
/// @param[in] removeExisting If true, removes any existing ArticulatedPoseController on the actor before adding a new one. If false, an existing controller causes an error.
/// @param[in,out] error Error status. Check @ref mochi::Error::IsOK "Error::IsOK" for success.
